Before inventing lore, systems, or plot: read `docs/vision/` and the relevant folder. Prefer `status: active` docs. Leave `TBD` / open questions instead of filling gaps. Capture new sparks in `docs/ideas/`.

Root `README.md` is the short public premise; keep it aligned with `docs/vision/premise.md`.

## Agent habits

- Prefer small, focused changes. Do not expand scope into unrequested systems.
- Do not invent multiplayer, live-service, or collaboration features.
- Distill durable conclusions into `docs/` rather than leaving them only in chat.
